## Payment APIs

### 1. Due amount (open payment screen with this)

`GET /api/payment/due?reservation_no=22260001`

```json
{
  "Error_Code": 0,
  "Message": "Due amount fetched successfully.",
  "due_amount": 35860,
  "checkout_status": 1,
  "data": {
    "Reservation_Id": 1,
    "Reservation_No": "22260001",
    "Guest_Name": "avinash",
    "Net_Amount": 36960,
    "Amount_Paid": 1100,
    "Due_Amount": 35860,
    "Checkout_Id": 7,
    "Checkout_Status": 1
  }
}
```

Use `data.Due_Amount` as the remaining amount field. Use `data.Checkout_Status` to know if checkout is done.

### 2. List

`GET /api/payment/list`  
`GET /api/payment/list?reservation_no=22260001`

```json
{
  "Error_Code": 0,
  "Message": "Payments fetched successfully.",
  "due_amount": 35860,
  "amount_paid": 1100,
  "net_amount": 36960,
  "checkout_status": 1,
  "data": [
    {
      "Collection_Id": 11,
      "Coll_Date": "2026-09-22",
      "Reservation_No": "22260001",
      "Coll_Amount": 1100,
      "Coll_Mode": 1,
      "Final_Coll": 0,
      "Status": 1,
      "Due_Amount": 35860,
      "Checkout_Id": 7,
      "Checkout_Status": 1
    }
  ]
}
```

`data[].Status` is the **payment** row (1 = active). `checkout_status` / `Checkout_Status` is the **checkout**.

### 3. Add payment

`POST /api/payment/add`

```json
{
  "reservation_no": "22260001",
  "coll_date": "2026-10-06",
  "remaining_amount": 35860,
  "coll_amount": 35860,
  "coll_mode": 1,
  "final_coll": false
}
```

| Field | Required | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `reservation_no` | yes | |
| `coll_date` | no | Defaults to today |
| `remaining_amount` | yes* | Amount being paid now. Can exceed due |
| `coll_amount` | no | Same as `remaining_amount` (alias). Send either |
| `coll_mode` | yes | Payment mode id (`1` = as used in existing screens) |
| `final_coll` | no | `false` = not final. If omitted, API sets `1` when paid amount >= due |

Do **not** send checkout status in the add body. Read it from due/list.

### 4. Details

`GET /api/payment/details/{collectionId}`

Includes `Checkout_Status` on the payment row.

### 5. Update

`PUT /api/payment/update/{collectionId}`

```json
{
  "reservation_no": "22260001",
  "coll_date": "2026-10-06",
  "coll_amount": 2000,
  "coll_mode": 1,
  "final_coll": false
}
```

### 6. Delete (soft)

`DELETE /api/payment/delete/{collectionId}`

Sets payment `Status = 0` and recalculates checkout `Amount_Paid`.

